 "strings": {
  "There's no doubt.": "",
  "No doubt about it.": "",
  "He's the one.\nLike it or not, he's going down.": "",
  "He's Shintani's killer.": "",
  "Apologies for keeping you\nin the dark.": "",
  "It was imperative for Ayabe to be completely\noblivious to our suspicions of him, after all.": "",
  "We didn't want Ayabe catching on\nthat we've suspected him for a while now.": "",
  "This is a murder charge against\nan active officer.": "",
  "After all, he's still on active duty.": "",
  "To put it plainly,\nit takes more effort to actually make an arrest.": "",
  "It takes some political maneuvering\nto arrest an officer of the law.": "",
  "So, we had to pretend\nyou were our primary suspect.": "",
  "So instead we made it look\nlike you were the suspect.": "",
  "You and Ayabe have gotten\nto be pretty cozy these days.": "",
  "You and Ayabe have gotten\npretty buddy-buddy.": "",
  "Suspecting you was the perfect\nway to divert his attention.": "",
  "It was the perfect misdirection.": "",
  "Okay then...": "",
  "So this was all some kinda act.": "",
  "So it was all just an act?": "",
  "An act?": "",
  "Not at all, I assure you.": "",
  "This is quite serious, actually.": "",
  "And I believe you should know,\nwe're aware of Ayabe's \"side\" job.": "",
  "Furthermore, this isn't where your role ends.": "",
  "Ayabe was an informant. A spy.\nHe was selling police intel on the black market.": "",
  "Officer Ayabe was leaking confidential\npolice intel outside the force...": "",
  "We plan to investigate those transactions\nthoroughly, Yagami-san.": "",
  "And we'll be investigating the extent\nof those leaks thoroughly.": "",
  "And so, it wouldn't surprise me in the slightest\nif we see you again in the near future.": "",
  "You may even be called upon to testify.": "",
  "Speak of the devil!\nWe were just talking about you...": "",
  "Yo, we were just talking about you...": "",
  "Ayabe-san.": "",
  "Officer Ayabe.": "",
  "Listen, Yagami.\nYou gotta help.": "",
  "Listen, Yagami.\nI'm in trouble here.": "",
  "Someone set me up.": "",
  "I'm getting arrested.": "",
  "They're saying I killed Shintani.\nMe. Me!": "",
  "Someone's trying to pin\nShintani's murder on me.": "",
  "Uh huh.": "",
  "You're... not surprised?": "",
  "Are you even surprised?": "",
  "Not quite. Already heard.": "",
  "Just heard about it myself, actually.": "",
  " I'm sitting here with\nthe prosecution as we speak.": "",
  "I'm with the guys issuing\nthe warrant now.": "",
  "Yeah, they're looking right at me.": "",
  "Yeah, they're staring right at me.": "",
  "Please, Yagami.\nYou have to take my case.": "",
  "I think I'll need you to defend me.": "",
  "I don't know where else to turn.": "",
  "You're the only guy who could.": "",
  "Okay. I'll do it.": "",
  "No problem.\nI can make that work.": "",
  "It's only fair after all you've done.": "",
  "I owe you one anyway.": "",
  "We can talk more later.\nI'll be there soon.": "",
  "I'll head down to the precinct.\nWe'll continue this there.": "",
  "So. I'll see you in court, then.": "",
  "Looks like I'll be seeing you in court.": "",
  "Who you have on the job?\nIzumida?": "",
  "I take it Prosecutor Izumida\nis on this one?": "",
  "Should be a good time.": "",
  "Someone is using you, prosecutor.": "",
  "But you're just the puppet here, aren't you?": "",
  "No matter who that person is...": "",
  "My real opponent...": "",
  "I'm not losing.": "",
  "...Is the one holding the strings.": "",
  "So that's the story, Genda-sensei.\nWe're gonna take the case.": "",
  "So that's the story, Sensei.\nCan someone at Genda Law represent Ayabe?": "",
  "Of course we are.": "",
  "What a mess...\nGot it.": "",
  "Anyway, you're gonna go talk to Ayabe,\nright? I'll send Hoshino-kun along.": "",
  "You're going to talk to Ayabe now?\nI'll let Hoshino-kun know.": "",
  "Yup. I'm heading over right now.": "",
  "Yeah.\nI'm on my way as we speak.": "",
  "It's open!": "",
  "I don't... understand.": "",
  "You planned this?": "",
  "My boy.": "",
  "My boy...": "",
  "You need to stay away\nfrom Hamura.": "",
  "You need to leave Hamura be.": "",
  "The Mole's my top priority now.": "",
  "It's the Mole I'm after right now.": "",
  "And Hamura's the only\nperson I can ask.": "",
  "I just wanted to ask\nthe captain some questions.": "",
  "Don't you understand?\nHamura's been compromised.": "",
  "It's one and the same.\nYou see that, don't you?": "",
  "Him and that Mole you're chasing?\nThey're in this together.": "",
  "Hamura and the Mole\nhave deep ties.": "",
  "Time to let it go.": "",
  "So put this to rest.": "",
  "What if I say no?": "",
  "And if I refuse?": "",
  "I couldn't tell you what might\nhappen. He's dangerous.": "",
  "It's dangerous to get any closer.\nTrust me.": "",
  "What do you mean,\nhe's dangerous?": "",
  "Dangerous how?": "",
  "If you can't tell me that,\nwhy should I stop?": "",
  "I won't give up without\na real reason.": "",
  "He has backing...": "",
  "The boy has money on his side,\nand a lot of it. ": "",
  "Someone more powerful\nthan even I know.": "",
  "And I...\ndon't know who he gets it from.": "",
  "Which is why I can't say any more.": "",
  "I suggest you don't\npush the matter.": "",
  "If you insist on pushing forward...": "",
  "But if you really want to put yourself in\nharm's way, then let me be the one to do it.": "",
  "I'll have to take you\nout of commission for a while.": "",
  "At least then you'll\nmake it out alive.": "",
  "At least you'd live that way.": "",
  "You'd do that?": "",
  "Sir...": "",
  "You know, you and Kaito, well...\nI've always tried to keep you two kids safe.": "",
  "I've looked after you two\nsince you were boys.": "",
  "All this time... I've never asked\nfor anything in return.": "",
  "I've never asked for much\nin return for that.": "",
  "But here we are.": "",
  "This is... the only thing\nthat I'll ever ask of you.": "",
  "So this is the first and the last time.": "",
  "Abandon this pursuit\nof the Mole.": "",
  "Why not get out of town for a while?": "",
  "If you've ever held\na shred of regard for me...": "",
  "If you feel even remotely\nindebted to me...": "",
  "Then heed this one request.": "",
  "Grant me this one request.": "",
  "I'm not turning back.\nThe risk doesn't matter anymore.": "",
  "The Mole is involved with the ADDC.": "",
  "Okubo, the Mole, the ADDC,\nit all connects.": "",
  "It's coming full circle to Okubo's\ncase three years ago, too.": "",
  "This isn't about what\nregard I have for you.": "",
  "Call me an ingrate\nif you want, but...": "",
  "I won't stop.": "",
  "I won't back down.": "",
  "Then I'm sorry.": "",
  "You goddamn fool...": "",
  "Boss.": "",
  "I've always looked up to you...\nAnd good yakuza don't disobey.": "",
  "Your orders have always\nbeen absolute to me.": "",
  "But now...": "",
  "But it's different now.": "",
  " I'm in Yagami's corner, dammit.": "",
  "Now I'm with\nthe Yagami Detective Agency.": "",
  "Yes, that you are.": "",
  "Yes, true enough.": "",
  "Matsugane-san!": "",
  "Sir...!": "",
  "Higashi!": "",
  "Sir!": "",
  "Yes, sir!?": "",
  "Pick your side.": "",
  "Time to choose.": "",
  "I've had enough.\nYou're Matsugane, are you not?": "",
  "You're a Matsugane man, aren't you?": "",
  "I am, boss.": "",
  "Of course, sir!": "",
  "Prove it then.": "",
  "Prove it, then.": "",
  "Bad luck, dude.\nGuess we're doin' this, huh?": "",
  "You jackass. Why're you staring\nlike a deer in headlights?": "",
  "Not like we got a choice.": "",
  "You don't have a choice now.": "",
  "And now that we're up against the wall,\nyou're just gonna have to do it.": "",
  "And that being the case,\nyou've gotta come at me to kill.": "",
  "Let's see what you've got!": "",
  "So man the fuck up!": "",
  "I'm sure he's gonna be just fine...": "",
  "A pep talk, really?": "",
  "Time to die!": "",
  "Let's fuckin' go!": "",
  "That was simple for you two.\nFar too simple.": "",
  "You two are really something.": "",
  "Makes me realize\nhow old I really am.": "",
  "All those yakuza couldn't stop you.": "",
  "It's a shame, isn't it?\nThat I've all but faded away.": "",
  "By comparison,\nI've really lost my way.": "",
  "Ah... Time sure flies, my boy.": "",
  "Wouldn't you say, my boy?": "",
  "Just gets worse and worse\nwith every year.": "",
  "Back when we first met...": "",
  "Damn tragic.": "",
  "Things were different.": "",
  "Matsugane...": "",
  "And stay down, asshole!": "",
  "Stay down already,\nyou little shit!": "",
  "Not gonna be... that easy...": "",
  "I'm not... done yet...": "",
  "Heh, you're really laying\nit on him, Kaito!": "",
  "You're handing that boy his ass, Kaito.": "",
  "Oh, boss.": "",
  "Boss?": "",
  "Is this the Yagami kid\nyou were talking about?": "",
  "This is that Yagami kid\nyou mentioned?": "",
  "Yup. Happens every fuckin' time\nI run into the guy.": "",
  "Yeah, it's the same story\nevery time we meet.": "",
  "So, asshole.": "",
  "Hey, kid.": "",
  "You get some kinda sick pleasure\noutta him beating the crap outta you?": "",
  "Do you enjoy getting\nyour ass kicked by Kaito?": "",
  "Time after time,\nyou just keep coming back for seconds.": "",
  "No matter how often you lose,\nyou keep antagonizing him.": "",
  "You all right in the brain, kiddo?": "",
  "You got a few screws loose?": "",
  "I'm saner than you,\nyou bullshit yakuza!": "",
  "I'm not crazy,\nyou piece of shit yakuza!": "",
  "Heh. \"Bullshit yakuza\", huh?": "",
  "Piece of shit yakuza, eh?": "",
  "Some rotten attitude you got there.": "",
  "You've got an attitude problem.": "",
  "Why don't you go fuck yourself!?": "",
  "Like you've got room to talk!": "",
  "Who the fuck do you think you are!?": "",
  "Don't get cocky, you little punk!": "",
  "Wha?": "",
  "Heh. Back in the day...": "",
  "You know...": "",
  "...I was a lot more like you\nthan I think you even know.": "",
  "I was just like you,\nonce upon a time.": "",
  "I was in a real bad place, so I just started\npunching anything that pissed me off.": "",
  "I'd given up on life, and I was punching\nanything that pissed me off.": "",
  "And before long, my time was up. Nowhere left\nfor me to go except this cesspool of a city.": "",
  "Before I knew it, the only place\nI belonged was in this dump of a city.": "",
  "And you, my boy...\nThat's exactly where you are.": "",
  "That sound about right?": "",
  "Don't talk like you know me...": "",
  "Shut up...!": "",
  "You don't know shit!": "",
  "Don't talk like you know me.": "",
  "Oh but I do, you see.": "",
  "I know you well enough.": "",
  "When I was your age, my life was going down\nthe shitter, and I just kept flushing.": "",
  "I've been making the wrong calls\nand regretting it since I was a boy.": "",
  "And now...": "",
  "So believe me...": "",
  "You, my boy...\nYou're the same little punk I was.": "",
  "I can recognize a punk in one look.": "",
  "I can tell.": "",
  "Am I wrong?": "",
  "You know... Sometimes people have\nno choice but to turn to the yakuza.": "",
  "Except for me, going yakuza\nwas basically my only choice.": "",
  "But... even if my chance is gone...": "",
  "But at your age...": "",
  "You've got a future ahead o' ya.": "",
  "You've got options still.": "",
  "Now, I might've called\nthis place a cesspool...": "",
  "I know I called this city a dump...　": ""
 },
